OL,3,GNEWSATrams withdrawn due to 'major
OL,4,Acommunications issue'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll tram services in Nottingham have
OL,7,Fbeen withdrawn due to a "major
OL,8,Fcommunications issue".
OL,10,FNottingham Express Transit (NET) warned
OL,11,Fof the disruption due a fault in a
OL,12,Fservice update at 20:15 GMT on Sunday.
OL,14,FIn the update on its app, the operator
OL,15,Fsaid: "Unfortunately, we're unable to
OL,16,Fcommunicate with our trams and for
OL,17,Fsafety reasons we must withdraw all
OL,18,Fservices."
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
