OL,3,GNEWSATrams withdrawn due to 'major
OL,4,Acommunications issue'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt apologised for any inconvenience,
OL,7,Fand said tram customers would be able
OL,8,Fto use their tickets and passes on
OL,9,FNottingham City Transport Services.
